00:01:08.410 --> 00:01:10.260
The world is watching what's taking place.

00:01:10.260 --> 00:01:12.990
We're going to count all the votes when the
process is complete.

00:01:12.990 --> 00:01:14.880
They'll be electors selected.

00:01:14.880 --> 00:01:15.880
